  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Sandwich_Bar?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b0/Sandwich_Bar.png/revision/latest?cb=20250925211004\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Sandwich Bar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sandwich Bar\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Sandwich Bar</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Machine</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 61</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 180,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  2 d 4 h</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 slot(s)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3×3</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 67</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Sandwich Bar</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">production building</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 61.\n</p><p>It is used to make <a href=\"/wiki/bacon-toast-11995\" title=\"Bacon Toast\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">bacon toast</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/egg-sandwich-9429\" title=\"Egg Sandwich\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">egg sandwiches</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/goat-cheese-toast-26431\" title=\"Goat Cheese Toast\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">goat cheese toasts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/honey-toast-15783\" title=\"Honey Toast\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">honey toast</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/peanut-butter-jelly-sandwich-33963\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Peanut Butter &amp;amp; Jelly Sandwich\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">peanut butter &amp; jelly sandwich</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/onion-melt-29367\" title=\"Onion Melt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">onion melts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/veggie-bagel-9427\" title=\"Veggie Bagel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">veggie bagels</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/hummus-wrap-35388\" title=\"Hummus Wrap\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">hummus wraps</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Building</b></span></h3>\n<p>It costs 180,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> and takes 2 days and 4 hours (or 67 <span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>) to build the Sandwich Bar. It gives players 34 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> when completed.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Products</b></span></h3>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/veggie-bagel-9427\" title=\"Veggie bagel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Veggie bagel\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/bacon-toast-11995\" title=\"Bacon toast\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bacon toast\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/egg-sandwich-9429\" title=\"Egg sandwich\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Egg sandwich\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/veggie-bagel-9427\" title=\"Veggie Bagel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Veggie Bagel</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/bacon-toast-11995\" title=\"Bacon Toast\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bacon Toast</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/egg-sandwich-9429\" title=\"Egg Sandwich\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Egg Sandwich</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 61\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 65\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 66\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>40 min\n</td>\n<td>1 h 40 min\n</td>\n<td>1 h 20 min\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>★★★ 34 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 1 h 25 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 1 h 8 min\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>5<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></s